      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's a good start, but it feels a bit like a textbook summary. can u make it more... visceral? i want to feel the weight of the Senator's experience vs the activist's energy. maybe have the Senator point out how the activist's idealism doesn't actually hold up when you look at how the world actually works.",
